der-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>集群规格</span></strong></p></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>包月价格：7105 月/元</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>proxy: 8C8G × 1</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>mixcoord: 1C2G × 1</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>querynode: 48C48G × 1</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>datanode: 2C4G × 1</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>indexnode：池化，按需付费</span></p></li></ul><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>测试结果</span></strong></p></div></div></div><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>QPS：20420，在固定资源预算下显著提升单位资源吞吐</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Latency：p99 延迟 2.7ms，平均延迟 2.5ms</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>导入时间：约 4515s</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Recall: 93.9%</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>综合开源 VectorDBBench 结果：QPS 排名第一，导入时间排名第二，p99 延迟并列第三，Recall 排名第四</span></p></li></ul><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>复现说明</span></strong></p></div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>参考 </span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>Milvus 向量检索性能测试操作手册</span></strong><span>。在固定数据集、固定 Recall 和固定延迟约束下，火山 Milvus 将 QPS 提升至 20420，同时将 p99 延迟稳定保持在 2.7ms。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>这里复现的不只是一组榜单成绩，更是一条可量化的成本效率提升路径：用同样的在线资源承载更多查询，同时不牺牲召回质量和尾延迟稳定性。</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"